255	## Advanced: Test HTTP Transport
256	
257	If you want to test HTTP transport for 12 users:
258	
259	### Start HTTP Server
260	```bash
261	cd d:\Promete\Project\mcp-openproject\openproject-mcp-server
262	
263	# Set API keys
264	set MCP_API_KEYS=test-key:TestUser
265	
266	# Start server
267	uv run python openproject-mcp-http.py
268	```
269	
270	### Test with curl
271	```bash
272	# List tools
273	curl http://localhost:8000/mcp/tools
274	
275	# Call tool
276	curl -H "Authorization: Bearer test-key" \
277	     -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
278	     -X POST http://localhost:8000/mcp/tools/call \
279	     -d "{\"name\": \"test_connection\", \"arguments\": {}}"
280	```
