1129	                - project_id (str): Project containing the task
1130	                - pin (bool): True to pin, False to unpin (default True)
1131	            - response_format (str): 'markdown' (default) or 'json'
1132	
1133	    Returns:
1134	        Success confirmation with updated task details.
1135	
1136	    Examples:
1137	        Pin single task:
1138	            tasks=[{"task_id": "abc123", "project_id": "proj1", "pin": true}]
1139	
1140	        Unpin task:
1141	            tasks=[{"task_id": "abc123", "project_id": "proj1", "pin": false}]
1142	
1143	        Pin multiple:
1144	            tasks=[
1145	                {"task_id": "abc1", "project_id": "proj1", "pin": true},
