1470	
1471	        Kanban board for project management:
1472	            name="Sprint Board", view_mode="kanban"
1473	
1474	        Timeline for scheduling:
1475	            name="Project Timeline", view_mode="timeline"
1476	
1477	        Note project:
1478	            name="Meeting Notes", kind="NOTE"
