384	            max_depth: Maximum traversal depth
385	
386	        Returns:
387	            List of related Skill objects
388	
389	        Performance:
390	        - Time Complexity: O(n + e) for BFS traversal
391	        - Expected: <10ms for 1000 skills
392	
393	        Example:
394	            >>> engine = IndexingEngine(skill_manager=manager)
395	            >>> related = engine.get_related_skills("anthropics/pytest", max_depth=2)
396	            >>> related[0].name
