390	        Configuration loading priority:
391	        1. Explicit kwargs (highest priority)
392	        2. Environment variables (MCP_SKILLS_*)
393	        3. Config file (~/.mcp-skillset/config.yaml)
394	        4. Defaults (lowest priority)
395	        """
396	        # Load YAML config if not provided in kwargs
