## 2. How the server initializes -- IndexingEngine and ChromaDB

### IndexingEngine (`/home/silimon/mcp-auto/claude_code/mcp_server/1101640542_bobmatnyc_mcp-skillset/src/mcp_skills/services/indexing/engine.py`)

**Class definition:** line 65. **`__init__`** spans lines 105-195.

Key initialization sequence in `IndexingEngine.__init__`:

```python
